{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"c4984865a36f81138c82e61e1ff8ed1131c1d78b1c80e0f356cd59b636f5dd42","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["施洗约翰传道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，有施洗的约翰出来，在犹太的旷野传道，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「天国近了，你们应当悔改！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["这人就是先知以赛亚所说的。他说：「在旷野有人声喊着说：",{"text":"预备主的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修直他的路！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这约翰身穿骆驼毛的衣服，腰束皮带，吃的是蝗虫、野蜜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那时，耶路撒冷和犹太全地，并约旦河一带地方的人，都出去到约翰那里，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["承认他们的罪，在约旦河里受他的洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["约翰看见许多法利赛人和撒都该人也来受洗，就对他们说：「毒蛇的种类！谁指示你们逃避将来的愤怒呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要结出果子来，与悔改的心相称。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不要自己心里说：『有亚伯拉罕为我们的祖宗。』我告诉你们， 神能从这些石头中给亚伯拉罕兴起子孙来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["现在斧子已经放在树根上，凡不结好果子的树就砍下来，丢在火里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我是用水给你们施洗，叫你们悔改。但那在我以后来的，能力比我更大，我就是给他提鞋也不配。他要用圣灵与火给你们施洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他手里拿着簸箕，要扬净他的场，把麦子收在仓里，把糠用不灭的火烧尽了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣受洗"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["当下，耶稣从加利利来到约旦河，见了约翰，要受他的洗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["约翰想要拦住他，说：「我当受你的洗，你反倒上我这里来吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶稣回答说：「你暂且许我，因为我们理当这样尽诸般的义",{"noteId":2},"。」于是约翰许了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶稣受了洗，随即从水里上来。天忽然为他开了，他就看见 神的灵仿佛鸽子降下，落在他身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["从天上有声音说：「这是我的爱子，我所喜悦的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"或译：礼","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}